# Methodology

How GROUNDED NO MORE turns a simulated airline into planning decisions, and how those decisions are tested. The contract every module builds against is in [`docs/data_contract.md`](docs/data_contract.md); every parameter is in [`config/assumptions.yaml`](config/assumptions.yaml), the part catalogue in [`config/part_catalogue.csv`](config/part_catalogue.csv), and both are listed in the [assumption register](docs/assumption_register.md).

Parameter values quoted below come from the config and are **ASSUMED** unless marked otherwise. Result values are computed from `outputs/` and `docs/data/` by `scripts/render_docs.py`, which renders this file from `docs/templates/METHODOLOGY.md.tmpl`. Headline results are from the v2 holdout (seeds {{RESULT:seeds.holdout}}, central world) unless labelled "selection" (seeds {{RESULT:seeds.selection}}). A v1 world was archived after a domain review; see [archive/v1](archive/v1/README.md).

